# License

CoDesign MCP is free to use locally. This file explains what you can and cannot
do with it.

## What you can do

You may install and run CoDesign on your own machines, for personal or
commercial work, at no cost during the preview. Designs you create with CoDesign
are yours. You may use them however you like.

## What you cannot do

You may not copy, modify, sell, sublicense, or redistribute the CoDesign
software or the CE.SDK engine it contains. You may not bundle it inside your own
product or service, or offer it to others as a hosted service. You may not
reverse-engineer it or remove license or copyright notices.

## Ownership

CoDesign and CE.SDK remain the property of IMG.LY GmbH. This license gives you
permission to use the software; it does not transfer any rights to it.

## Preview terms

This is a preview. Features may change or be removed, and the software may stop
working after a preview version expires. IMG.LY GmbH may change these terms, or
end the free preview, at any time. When the preview ends, continued use will
require a new license.

